### Journal Entries API — REST Client

```http
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/finance/journal
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkxODA1NTgxLCJpYXQiOjE3OTE3NzY3ODEsImp0aSI6Ijk1MzBmNjk2YTQ3ZTRkOWE4MzI4OWE4MTk4Yjk3Mjg0IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6MiwiaXNfc3VwZXJhZG1pbiI6ZmFsc2UsImlzX2hyX2FkbWluIjp0cnVlLCJpc19lbXBsb3llZSI6ZmFsc2UsImlzX2hyIjpmYWxzZX0.da_L8SHYfs4Fnr6vYSYYmaHujlrEkVaZ94c6oi-Xwmo
@entryId = 1

### 1. List Journal Entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. List Entries with Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Filter Manual Entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/?source=manual
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Filter Automatic Entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/?source=auto
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Filter Draft Entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/?status=draft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Filter Posted Entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/?status=posted
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Search Journal Entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/?search=depreciation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Create a Manual Journal Entry (Draft)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_date": "2026-10-09",
  "reference_number": "REF-001",
  "description": "Monthly depreciation",
  "lines": [
    {
      "account_id": 1,
      "account_name": "Depreciation Expense",
      "description": "Monthly depreciation expense",
      "debit_amount": "5000.00",
      "credit_amount": "0.00"
    },
    {
      "account_id": 2,
      "account_name": "Fixed Asset - Equipment",
      "description": "Accumulated depreciation",
      "debit_amount": "0.00",
      "credit_amount": "5000.00"
    }
  ]
}

### 9. Retrieve a Journal Entry
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{entryId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Update a Draft Journal Entry
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{entryId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_date": "2026-10-09",
  "reference_number": "REF-001-UPDATED",
  "description": "Updated monthly depreciation"
}

### 11. Update Draft Entry Lines
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{entryId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    {
      "account_id": 1,
      "account_name": "Depreciation Expense",
      "description": "Monthly depreciation expense",
      "debit_amount": "6000.00",
      "credit_amount": "0.00"
    },
    {
      "account_id": 2,
      "account_name": "Fixed Asset - Equipment",
      "description": "Accumulated depreciation",
      "debit_amount": "0.00",
      "credit_amount": "6000.00"
    }
  ]
}

### 12. Post a Journal Entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{entryId}}/post/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Void a Posted Journal Entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{entryId}}/void/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Delete a Draft Journal Entry
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{entryId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Order by Entry Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/?ordering=-entry_date
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Superadmin — Filter by Company
GET {{baseUrl}}/?company=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
```
